{"speciesId":221,"names":{"fr":"Cochignon","es":"Piloswine","en":"Piloswine","ja":"イノムー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Because the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"If it charges at an enemy, the hairs on its back stand up straight. It is very sensi­ tive to sound."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Although its legs are short, its rugged hooves prevent it from slipping, even on icy ground."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"PILOSWINE is covered by a thick coat of long hair that enables it to endure the freezing cold. This POKéMON uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"PILOSWINE is covered by a thick coat of long hair that enables it to endure the freezing cold. This POKéMON uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A PILOSWINE is covered by a thick coat of long hair for enduring freezing cold. It uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"If it charges at an enemy, the hairs on its back stand up straight. It is very sensitive to sound."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Because the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its shaggy coat makes it unable to see. It checks surroundings with its sensitive nose instead."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its shaggy coat makes it unable to see. It checks surroundings with its sensitive nose instead."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Covered by a shaggy coat, it is strong against the cold. Its tusks of ice thicken when it snows."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Because the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If it charges at an enemy, the hairs on its back stand up straight. It is very sensitive to sound."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est protégé du froid mordant par son épais manteau de fourrure. Ses cornes sont formées de glace."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Covered by a shaggy coat, it is strong against the cold. Its tusks of ice thicken when it snows."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est protégé du froid mordant par son épais manteau de fourrure. Ses cornes sont formées de glace."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Covered by a shaggy coat, it is strong against the cold. Its tusks of ice thicken when it snows."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"With its excellent sense of smell, it’s even able to find mushrooms that are buried under frozen ground."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"With its excellent sense of smell, it’s even able to find mushrooms that are buried under frozen ground."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Bien que pourvu de courtes pattes, ses sabots sont pointus pour l’empêcher de glisser sur la glace."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Aunque tiene las patas cortas, las fuertes pezuñas le permiten agarrarse bien al suelo, a pesar del hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Although its legs are short, its rugged hooves prevent it from slipping, even on icy ground."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"４本の 脚は 短いが ひづめは 広く ギザギザ なので 雪の上でも 滑らず 歩ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses yeux sont masqués par ses longs poils. Il ne voit rien et se déplace en chargeant."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Como su largo pelaje le impide ver con claridad, sigue atacando repetidamente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Because the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"長い 体毛に 覆われて 目の前の 様子が わからず ひたすらに 突進を 繰り返す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cochignon est recouvert de longs poils épais qui lui permettent de supporter le froid hivernal. Ce Pokémon utilise ses défenses pour déterrer la nourriture cachée sous la glace."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Piloswine está cubierto por un pelaje tupido y de largas cerdas que le permite soportar el frío polar. Este Pokémon usa los colmillos para desenterrar los alimentos que hayan podido quedar bajo el hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Piloswine is covered by a thick coat of long hair that enables it to endure the freezing cold. This Pokémon uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"凍える 寒さにも 耐えられる ように 厚くて 長い 毛皮に 覆われている。 氷に 埋まった エサを キバで 掘り出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cochignon est recouvert de longs poils épais qui lui permettent de supporter le froid hivernal. Ce Pokémon utilise ses défenses pour déterrer la nourriture cachée sous la glace."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Piloswine está cubierto por un pelaje tupido y de largas cerdas que le permite soportar el frío polar. Este Pokémon usa los colmillos para desenterrar los alimentos que hayan podido quedar bajo el hielo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Piloswine is covered by a thick coat of long hair that enables it to endure the freezing cold. This Pokémon uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"凍える 寒さにも 耐えられる ように 厚くて 長い 毛皮に 覆われている。 氷に 埋まった エサを キバで 掘り出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"S’il charge un ennemi, les poils de son dos se dressent. Il est très sensible au bruit."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando carga contra un enemigo, se le erizan los pelos del lomo. Es muy sensible al sonido."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If it charges at an enemy, the hairs on its back stand up straight. It is very sensitive to sound."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"相手 めがけて 突進するとき 背中の 体毛が 逆立つ。 音に ものすごく 敏感。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Bien qu’il soit pourvu de pattes courtes, ses sabots larges et pointus l’empêchent de glisser sur la glace."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Aunque tiene las patas cortas, sus fuertes pezuñas le permiten caminar por la nieve sin resbalar."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Although its legs are short, its rugged hooves prevent it from slipping, even on icy ground."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"４本の 脚は 短いが ひづめは 広く ギザギザ なので 雪の上でも 滑らず 歩ける。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"The long fur of this Pokémon covers its eyes, ears, and even limbs, allowing Piloswine to resist harshly frigid conditions. The Pokémon's white tusks can be used to defeat its enemies."}],"varieties":[{"id":221,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"horn-attack","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[3,"level-up",33],[4,"level-up",33],[5,"level-up",33],[6,"level-up",33],[7,"level-up",33],[8,"level-up",33],[9,"level-up",33],[10,"level-up",33],[11,"level-up",33],[12,"level-up",33],[13,"level-up",33],[14,"level-up",33],[15,"level-up",33],[16,"level-up",33],[17,"level-up",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",0],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[3,"level-up",28],[4,"level-up",28],[5,"level-up",28],[6,"level-up",28],[7,"level-up",28],[8,"level-up",32],[9,"level-up",32],[10,"level-up",32],[11,"level-up",32],[12,"level-up",28],[13,"level-up",28],